   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="MS-SCHNITZLER-B-0008-B-00001-000-00100"/>
                  <hi rend="pre-print">A</hi>n D<hi rend="superscript">r</hi> Arthur
                  Schnitzler</addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs ref="#pmb41240" type="place">Austria</rs></addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs ref="#pmb50" type="place">Wien</rs></addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs ref="#pmb168934" type="place">IX Frankgasse 1</rs></addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <p>
               <pb facs="MS-SCHNITZLER-B-0008-B-00001-000-00099"/>
               <salute>Lieber Arthur!</salute> Soeben
               erhalte Karte. <del rend="strikethrough">Alle <rs ref="#pmb36340" type="work">Zeit</rs>
               </del> Brief »Lieber Bek.« erhalten »<hi rend="underline" n="1">
                  <rs ref="#pmb36340" type="work">Zeit</rs>
               </hi>« nicht. Bitte senden Sie Brief u <rs ref="#pmb36340" type="work">Zeit</rs> nach
                  <rs ref="#pmb595" type="place">Neapel</rs> (<rs ref="#pmb595" type="place">Napoli</rs>) a posta ferma. Schreibe morgen ausführlicher. Bin zu abgehetzt.</p>
            <closer>Herzlichst<signed>Richard</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
